# Title: 7Zip Compressing Dump Files
# ID: ec570e53-4c76-45a9-804d-dc3f355ff7a7
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-27
# Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
# Description: Detects execution of 7z in order to compress a file with a ".dmp"/".dump" extension, which could be a step in a process of dump file exfiltration.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*.dmp* OR process.command_line:*.dump* OR process.command_line:*.hdmp*)) AND ((Description:*7-Zip*) OR ((process.executable:*\\7z.exe OR process.executable:*\\7zr.exe OR process.executable:*\\7za.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"7z.exe" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"7za.exe" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"7zr.exe"))))
